Z||000017||Formula||11-06-2001||02:52 PM||||heres how I say it....<P>Torque.... Joe benches 300 lbs in 5 secs..<P>horsepower... John benches 300 lbs in 2 secs..<P>both joe and john have 300 ft lbs of torque but john has more horsepower.||||reg||1
